Package: folio-gable
Version: 3.0.0
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 18000
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libwayland-client0, folio-fonts
Recommends: xdg-utils, fonts-dejavu-core, wl-clipboard
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: 3D modeller in the manner of SketchUp
 Folio Gable draws in three dimensions the way a pencil does: lines that close
 into faces, and faces pushed and pulled into solids. Rectangles and circles,
 move, erase and paint, the tape measure, orbit, pan and zoom, perspective or
 parallel, shaded or wireframe, in millimetres, inches or feet. It draws
 without a graphics card, so a drawing looks the same on every machine, and
 writes .obj and .stl for other programs. Everything stays on this computer.
